Scope ring status precedence to pending offers and accept changed cancellations

Accepted precedence in offer info now applies only while an offer is pending; terminal info always reports the evidence the release selected. A cancellation release (reason 11) requires Cancelled evidence regardless of changed_generation, which the runtime sets from its read check independently of the stopped reason; such a release refuses, reports Cancelled, and frees the slot.
